Rule: Use unique keys across all rooms. Light/heat/plug/lock/fan require on; lock on:true means locked. Heat requires temp 5–30 °C and may have reading; heat MUST have level:null, unit:null, normal:null. Celsius is implicit for heat: never write unit:celsius on a thermostat.
